s","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ZLR0o9tuGaUAdrhJE2z69w","review_id":"GwBK9bEyOlgEUSPA_HwJUg","date":"2016-06-21T18:49:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9330892562866211,"text_excerpt":"Silly tourists, we wandered onto Frenchmen Street in the morning, thinking there would be anything at all to do. Sadly this area is only active at night. But thankfully we stumbled into Cafe Rose Nicaud for brunch--so happy we did! The place is a cute little French-inspired bakery and cafe. The prices are very reasonable, and the menu caters to all sorts of diet-friendly fare (gluten free, veg, and vegan are all represented here). I treated myself to the Rose Benedict with Alligator Sausage and their signature Ginger Limeade. My fiance got the same drink with his Southern Breakfast. I'm a bit of a Benedict snob, and Rose definitely delivered. The biscuits were really the star of the meal-..."},{"business_id":"ZLR0o9tuGaUAdrhJE2z69w","review_id":"t_ht6YNY1TGjsLUAyNwyLw","date":"2014-11-03T12:06:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9237534999847412,"text_excerpt":"My bf and I came here for brunch one day during our stay in New Orleans, after reading a review of the rose benedict. It definitely lived up to the hype. The cafe is small and kitsch, the coffee is delicious! They use locally roasted stuff. We split the benedict with rosemary grits, alligator sausage, avocado, portabella, and fried eggs. Holy SH*T the girl back there can cook. Flavors were delicious and it filled both of us up for several hours. Looking forward to a return visit next time we're in town."},{"business_id":"ZLR0o9tuGaUAdrhJE2z69w","review_id":"fHRu3Scd-JrmGR93kBFXQA","date":"2014-07-30T07:28:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9236491322517395,"text_excerpt":"Such a sweet cafe with great breakfast sandwiches. There are a bunch of veg options and the menu is quite accommodating. I went in for Easter brunch and it was absolutely lovely eating outside and people watching. I love this side of town, the houses are so gorgeous."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZLR0o9tuGaUAdrhJE2z69w","photo_id":"4A8SwbjMy5TY8ywG2CmatQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4A8SwbjMy5TY8ywG2CmatQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
